---
import BaseLayout from "../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="三维旋转的顺序为什么重要？ — J.H. Lab" description="亲手操作三维旋转，比较先绕 X 轴再绕 Y 轴与反过来的结果。">
 <article id="rotation-lab" class="rotation-lab wrap">
  <header class="lab-head" id="top">
   <div class="head-meta">
    <p class="eyebrow">J.H. LAB / EXPERIMENT 001</p>
    <a class="back-link" href="/lab/"><span data-locale="zh">← 返回知识实验室</span><span data-locale="en">← Back to Knowledge Lab</span></a>
   </div>
   <h1><span data-locale="zh">先转 X，再转 Y。<br/>结果会一样吗？</span><span data-locale="en">Rotate X, then Y.<br/>Does order matter?</span></h1>
   <p class="lead"><span data-locale="zh">三维旋转不满足交换律。不要先相信这句话——试着自己交换操作顺序，让矩阵和立方体一起变化。</span><span data-locale="en">3D rotations do not generally commute. Don't take our word for it — swap the order and watch the matrices and the cubes change together.</span></p>
  </header>

  <div class="workbench">
   <div class="wb-rail">
    <div class="rail-card">
     <section class="control-area" aria-labelledby="control-title">
      <div class="section-line"><h2 id="control-title"><span data-locale="zh">设置两个旋转</span><span data-locale="en">Set two rotations</span></h2><button id="rotation-reset" type="button"><span data-locale="zh">重置实验</span><span data-locale="en">Reset</span> ↺</button></div>
      <div class="sliders">
       <div class="slider-block"><label for="angle-x"><span data-locale="zh">绕 X 轴</span><span data-locale="en">Around X axis</span></label><output id="angle-x-value" for="angle-x">90°</output><input type="range" min="0" max="180" step="15" value="90" id="angle-x" aria-label="绕 X 轴角度" /></div>
       <div class="slider-block"><label for="angle-y"><span data-locale="zh">绕 Y 轴</span><span data-locale="en">Around Y axis</span></label><output id="angle-y-value" for="angle-y">90°</output><input type="range" min="0" max="180" step="15" value="90" id="angle-y" aria-label="绕 Y 轴角度" /></div>
      </div>
      <details class="preset-details">
       <summary><span data-locale="zh">试试特殊角度</span><span data-locale="en">Try a special case</span><span aria-hidden="true"> ▾</span></summary>
       <div class="rotation-presets" role="group" aria-label="示例角度 / Example angles">
        <button type="button" data-rotation-preset="different"><span data-locale="zh">90° + 90° · 结果不同</span><span data-locale="en">90° + 90° · Different</span></button>
        <button type="button" data-rotation-preset="same"><span data-locale="zh">0° + 90° · 特殊重合</span><span data-locale="en">0° + 90° · Special case</span></button>
       </div>
      </details>
     </section>

     <section class="steps" aria-labelledby="steps-title">
      <div class="section-line"><h2 id="steps-title"><span data-locale="zh">分步观察</span><span data-locale="en">Walk through the rotation</span></h2></div>
      <div class="step-buttons" role="group" aria-label="旋转步骤 / Rotation stages">
       <button type="button" data-rotation-step="0" aria-pressed="false"><span data-locale="zh">① 初始</span><span data-locale="en">① Start</span></button>
       <button type="button" data-rotation-step="1" aria-pressed="false"><span data-locale="zh">② 第一次旋转</span><span data-locale="en">② First rotation</span></button>
       <button type="button" data-rotation-step="2" aria-pressed="true"><span data-locale="zh">③ 完成旋转</span><span data-locale="en">③ Both rotations</span></button>
      </div>
      <div class="playback-controls" role="group" aria-label="连续旋转演示 / Rotation playback">
       <button id="rotation-replay" type="button"><span aria-hidden="true">▶</span> <span data-locale="zh">播放两次旋转</span><span data-locale="en">Play both rotations</span></button>
       <button id="rotation-stop" type="button" hidden><span aria-hidden="true">■</span> <span data-locale="zh">停止演示</span><span data-locale="en">Stop animation</span></button>
      </div>
      <p id="rotation-step-explanation" class="step-explanation" role="status" aria-live="polite"><span data-locale="zh">第二步：左侧再绕 Y 轴，右侧再绕 X 轴。</span><span data-locale="en">Step 2: left adds Y, right adds X.</span></p>
     </section>

     <section class="prediction" id="rotation-prediction" aria-labelledby="prediction-title">
      <p class="prediction-kicker"><span data-locale="zh">先猜一下</span><span data-locale="en">Predict first</span></p>
      <h2 id="prediction-title"><span data-locale="zh">交换顺序，结果会一样吗？</span><span data-locale="en">Swap the order — same result?</span></h2>
      <div class="prediction-options" role="group" aria-label="预测结果 / Your prediction">
       <button type="button" data-rotation-prediction="same"><span data-locale="zh">会一样</span><span data-locale="en">Same</span></button>
       <button type="button" data-rotation-prediction="different"><span data-locale="zh">会不同</span><span data-locale="en">Different</span></button>
       <button type="button" data-rotation-prediction="skip" class="prediction-skip"><span data-locale="zh">跳过</span><span data-locale="en">Skip</span></button>
      </div>
      <p id="rotation-prediction-feedback" class="prediction-feedback" role="status" aria-live="polite" hidden></p>
     </section>
    </div>
   </div>

   <div class="wb-main">
    <section class="comparison" aria-labelledby="comparison-title">
     <div class="section-line"><h2 id="comparison-title"><span data-locale="zh">交换顺序，观察差别</span><span data-locale="en">Swap the order</span></h2><div class="camera-buttons"><button id="rotation-camera-left" type="button" aria-label="向左转动观察视角" title="向左转动观察视角">↶</button><button id="rotation-camera-right" type="button" aria-label="向右转动观察视角" title="向右转动观察视角">↷</button></div></div>
     <div class="mobile-view-tabs" role="group" aria-label="选择对比结果 / Choose comparison view">
      <button type="button" data-rotation-view="0" aria-pressed="true"><span data-locale="zh">A · 先 X 后 Y</span><span data-locale="en">A · X then Y</span></button>
      <button type="button" data-rotation-view="1" aria-pressed="false"><span data-locale="zh">B · 先 Y 后 X</span><span data-locale="en">B · Y then X</span></button>
     </div>
     <div class="compare-grid" id="rotation-comparison" role="region" tabindex="0" aria-label="旋转结果对比，手机端可左右滑动 / Swipe between two rotation results">
      <section class="outcome" aria-labelledby="order-xy-title">
       <div class="outcome-header"><span class="number">01</span><h3 id="order-xy-title"><span data-locale="zh">先 X，后 Y</span><span data-locale="en">X first, then Y</span></h3></div>
       <canvas id="rotation-xy" width="480" height="340" role="img" aria-label="先绕X轴后绕Y轴旋转后的立方体，可拖动改变观察角度"><span data-locale="zh">浏览器无法显示三维画布，请查看下方坐标结果。</span><span data-locale="en">Canvas unavailable; read the coordinates below.</span></canvas>
       <p class="coordinates"><span data-locale="zh">初始正面 Z 轴指向</span><span data-locale="en">Resulting front Z vector</span> <strong id="rotation-xy-vector">(0.00, -1.00, 0.00)</strong></p>
      </section>
      <section class="outcome" aria-labelledby="order-yx-title">
       <div class="outcome-header"><span class="number">02</span><h3 id="order-yx-title"><span data-locale="zh">先 Y，后 X</span><span data-locale="en">Y first, then X</span></h3></div>
       <canvas id="rotation-yx" width="480" height="340" role="img" aria-label="先绕Y轴后绕X轴旋转后的立方体，可拖动改变观察角度"><span data-locale="zh">浏览器无法显示三维画布，请查看下方坐标结果。</span><span data-locale="en">Canvas unavailable; read the coordinates below.</span></canvas>
       <p class="coordinates"><span data-locale="zh">初始正面 Z 轴指向</span><span data-locale="en">Resulting front Z vector</span> <strong id="rotation-yx-vector">(1.00, 0.00, 0.00)</strong></p>
      </section>
     </div>

     <section class="result" aria-labelledby="result-title">
      <div class="result-head">
       <h2 id="result-title"><span data-locale="zh">对比结果</span><span data-locale="en">The result</span></h2>
       <div class="result-metric"><span><span data-locale="zh">姿态差距</span><span data-locale="en">Difference</span></span><output id="rotation-difference" aria-live="polite" aria-label="旋转矩阵间的 Frobenius 距离，0 表示姿态相同，不是角度">2.45</output></div>
      </div>
      <p class="metric-definition"><span data-locale="zh">旋转矩阵间的 <strong>Frobenius 距离</strong>，范围 0–2.83（最大 2√2）。0 = 两种顺序的最终姿态相同；它不是角度。</span><span data-locale="en">The <strong>Frobenius distance</strong> between the two final rotation matrices, range 0–2.83 (max 2√2). 0 = identical final orientation; it is not an angle.</span></p>
      <div class="metric-scale-wrap">
       <div class="metric-scale" role="img" aria-label="姿态差距刻度，0 到 2.83"><span id="rotation-difference-fill" class="metric-fill"></span></div>
       <div class="metric-scale-ends"><span>0</span><span>2√2 ≈ 2.83</span></div>
      </div>
      <p id="rotation-note" role="status" aria-live="polite"><span data-locale="zh">交换旋转顺序改变了最终姿态。观察立方体上不同颜色的面标记。</span><span data-locale="en">Changing the order changes the final 3D orientation. Compare the labelled faces.</span></p>
     </section>

     <section class="matrices" aria-labelledby="matrices-title">
      <div class="matrices-head"><h3 id="matrices-title"><span data-locale="zh">相关矩阵</span><span data-locale="en">Rotation matrices</span></h3><p><span data-locale="zh">列向量；最右侧矩阵先作用</span><span data-locale="en">Column vectors; rightmost matrix acts first</span></p></div>
      <div class="matrix-grid">
       <figure class="matrix-card"><figcaption><span data-locale="zh">绕 X 轴</span><span data-locale="en">Around X</span> · <span class="matrix-tag">R<sub>X</sub>(θ<sub>X</sub>)</span></figcaption><table class="m3" id="matrix-rx" aria-label="R_X 矩阵"><tbody><tr><td>1.00</td><td>0.00</td><td>0.00</td></tr><tr><td>0.00</td><td>0.00</td><td>-1.00</td></tr><tr><td>0.00</td><td>1.00</td><td>0.00</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>
       <figure class="matrix-card"><figcaption><span data-locale="zh">绕 Y 轴</span><span data-locale="en">Around Y</span> · <span class="matrix-tag">R<sub>Y</sub>(θ<sub>Y</sub>)</span></figcaption><table class="m3" id="matrix-ry" aria-label="R_Y 矩阵"><tbody><tr><td>0.00</td><td>0.00</td><td>1.00</td></tr><tr><td>0.00</td><td>1.00</td><td>0.00</td></tr><tr><td>-1.00</td><td>0.00</td><td>0.00</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>
       <figure class="matrix-card"><figcaption><span data-locale="zh">先 X 后 Y</span><span data-locale="en">X then Y</span> · <span class="matrix-tag">R<sub>Y</sub>R<sub>X</sub></span></figcaption><table class="m3" id="matrix-xy" aria-label="R_Y R_X 复合矩阵"><tbody><tr><td>0.00</td><td>1.00</td><td>0.00</td></tr><tr><td>0.00</td><td>0.00</td><td>-1.00</td></tr><tr><td>-1.00</td><td>0.00</td><td>0.00</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>
       <figure class="matrix-card"><figcaption><span data-locale="zh">先 Y 后 X</span><span data-locale="en">Y then X</span> · <span class="matrix-tag">R<sub>X</sub>R<sub>Y</sub></span></figcaption><table class="m3" id="matrix-yx" aria-label="R_X R_Y 复合矩阵"><tbody><tr><td>0.00</td><td>0.00</td><td>1.00</td></tr><tr><td>1.00</td><td>0.00</td><td>0.00</td></tr><tr><td>0.00</td><td>1.00</td><td>0.00</td></tr></tbody></table></figure>
      </div>
     </section>

     <details class="math-details">
      <summary><span data-locale="zh">为什么会这样？展开数学解释</span><span data-locale="en">Why? Read the mathematics</span><span aria-hidden="true"> ↓</span></summary>
      <div class="math-detail-content">
       <p class="math-line">R<sub>Y</sub>(θ<sub>Y</sub>) R<sub>X</sub>(θ<sub>X</sub>) <span aria-label="通常不等于">≠</span> R<sub>X</sub>(θ<sub>X</sub>) R<sub>Y</sub>(θ<sub>Y</sub>)</p>
       <p class="explainer"><span data-locale="zh">三维旋转属于旋转群 SO(3)。矩阵作用在列向量上，右侧的操作先执行，因此「先 X 后 Y」对应 RY · RX。旋转的先后顺序通常不可交换；某些特殊角度（如其中一个为 0°）可能得到相同结果。</span><span data-locale="en">Three-dimensional rotations form SO(3). With column vectors, the rightmost matrix acts first: X then Y means RY · RX. Order generally matters, although special cases (such as a zero angle) can coincide.</span></p>
      </div>
     </details>

     <button id="rotation-overlay-toggle" type="button" class="overlay-toggle" aria-controls="rotation-overlay-panel" aria-expanded="false"><span data-locale="zh">叠影对比两种姿态</span><span data-locale="en">Overlay both orientations</span> <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></button>
     <div id="rotation-overlay-panel" class="overlay-panel" hidden>
      <p class="overlay-legend"><span class="legend-blue"><span data-locale="zh">蓝 A：先 X 后 Y</span><span data-locale="en">Blue A: X then Y</span></span><span class="legend-orange"><span data-locale="zh">橙 B：先 Y 后 X</span><span data-locale="en">Orange B: Y then X</span></span></p>
      <canvas id="rotation-overlay" width="720" height="380" role="img" aria-label="蓝色 A 与橙色 B 的旋转坐标轴对比：Z 为实线，X 为虚线；外框仅用于辅助观察"></canvas>
      <p class="overlay-caption"><span data-locale="zh">正方体具有旋转对称性，因此外轮廓重合也可能是不同姿态。请比较蓝 A、橙 B 的实线 Z 轴与虚线 X 轴方向：两组方向一致，最终姿态才一致。</span><span data-locale="en">A cube is symmetric: overlapping outlines can still represent different orientations. Compare solid Z and dashed X axes for blue A versus orange B to determine whether the orientations actually agree.</span></p>
     </div>
     <p class="gesture-hint"><span data-locale="zh">操作按固定的世界 X、Y 轴进行；画面中的彩色箭头和面标记代表立方体自身的局部坐标轴，会随物体转动。拖动只改变两侧共同的观察视角。</span><span data-locale="en">Operations use fixed world X and Y axes. The colored arrows and face markers show the cube’s local axes, so they rotate with the object. Dragging changes only the shared camera.</span></p>
    </section>
   </div>
  </div>
  <footer class="lab-footer"><a href="/lab/"><span data-locale="zh">← 返回实验室</span><span data-locale="en">← Return to Lab</span></a><span>J.H. LAB / EXPERIMENT 001</span></footer>
 </article>
</BaseLayout>
<script>
 import "../../../lib/rotation-lab";
</script>
<style>
 .rotation-lab{max-width:1240px;margin:0 auto;padding:18px 0 56px}
 .lab-head{margin:0 0 14px}
 .head-meta{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap}
 .lab-head .eyebrow{font-size:10px;letter-spacing:.14em;margin:0}
 .back-link{margin:0;color:var(--muted);font-size:12px;text-decoration:none}
 h1{font-size:clamp(26px,3.2vw,42px);line-height:1.1;letter-spacing:-.045em;margin:9px 0 6px;max-width:920px}
 .lead{max-width:820px;font-size:clamp(12.5px,1.15vw,15px);line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted);margin:0}
 .workbench{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(248px,288px) minmax(0,1fr);gap:16px;align-items:start;border-top:1px solid var(--stroke);padding-top:13px}
 .wb-rail{display:grid;gap:10px;min-width:0}
 .rail-card{display:grid;gap:12px;background:var(--card);border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:16px;padding:12px 13px;min-width:0}
 .control-area{padding:0;border:0;min-width:0}
 .section-line{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;gap:10px;margin-bottom:8px;min-width:0}
 .section-line h2{font-size:13px;margin:0;letter-spacing:-.01em}
 .control-area #rotation-reset{min-height:34px;padding:5px 10px;font-size:11px;border-radius:99px}
 .sliders{display:grid;gap:6px}
 .slider-block{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto;gap:3px 8px;padding:2px 0;border:0;background:transparent;min-width:0}
 .slider-block label{font-size:11px;font-weight:600}
 .slider-block output{font-size:11.5px;color:var(--accent);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
 .slider-block input{grid-column:1/-1;width:100%;min-width:0;min-height:26px;margin:0;accent-color:var(--accent)}
 .preset-details{margin:0}
 .preset-details summary{cursor:pointer;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);width:max-content;max-width:100%;min-height:26px;padding:3px 0;list-style:none}
 .preset-details summary::-webkit-details-marker{display:none}
 .rotation-presets{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px;margin-top:4px}
 .rotation-presets button{min-height:32px;padding:4px 9px;border-radius:999px;font-size:10.5px}
 .steps{min-width:0}
 .step-buttons{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,minmax(0,1fr));gap:5px}
 .step-buttons button{min-height:36px;padding:6px 3px;border-radius:9px;font-size:10.5px;font-weight:600;white-space:normal;line-height:1.3}
 .step-buttons button[aria-pressed="true"]{background:var(--fg);color:var(--bg);border-color:var(--fg)}
 .playback-controls{display:flex;gap:7px;align-items:center;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:7px}
 .playback-controls button{min-height:34px;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:10px;font-size:11px;font-weight:600}
 .playback-controls button[hidden]{display:none!important}
 .playback-controls #rotation-replay{background:var(--fg);border-color:var(--fg);color:var(--bg)}
 .playback-controls #rotation-replay[aria-disabled="true"]{opacity:.6;cursor:default}
 .step-explanation{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);min-height:2.6em;margin:8px 0 0;line-height:1.5}
 .prediction{border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-left:3px solid var(--accent);border-radius:14px;padding:10px 12px;background:var(--card)}
 .prediction[hidden]{display:none!important}
 .prediction-kicker{font-size:9.5px;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--muted);margin:0 0 3px}
 .prediction h2{font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;margin:0 0 8px}
 .prediction-options{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:5px}
 .prediction-options button{min-height:32px;padding:5px 11px;border-radius:999px;font-size:11px}
 .prediction-options .prediction-skip{border-style:dashed;color:var(--muted)}
 .prediction-feedback{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);margin:8px 0 0;line-height:1.5}
 .wb-main{display:grid;gap:10px;min-width:0}
 .comparison{min-width:0}
 .camera-buttons{display:flex;gap:6px}
 .camera-buttons button{min-width:34px;min-height:34px;font-size:17px;padding:2px 8px}
 .mobile-view-tabs{display:none}
 .compare-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:12px;min-width:0}
 .outcome{min-width:0;border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;background:var(--card)}
 .outcome-header{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:9px;padding:10px 13px 0}
 .outcome-header .number{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted)}
 .outcome h3{font-size:14px;margin:0}
 .outcome canvas{display:block;width:100%;height:clamp(190px,23vh,258px);touch-action:none;cursor:grab;user-select:none}
 .outcome canvas:active{cursor:grabbing}
 .coordinates{border-top:1px solid var(--stroke);display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;justify-content:space-between;gap:3px 10px;padding:8px 13px;margin:0;font-size:11px;color:var(--muted)}
 .coordinates strong{color:var(--fg);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
 .result{border-top:1px solid var(--stroke);padding-top:9px;display:grid;gap:7px;min-width:0}
 .result-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap}
 .result-head h2{font-size:clamp(16px,1.7vw,22px);letter-spacing:-.02em;margin:0}
 .result-metric{display:flex;align-items:baseline;gap:9px;font-size:11.5px;color:var(--muted);white-space:nowrap}
 .result-metric output{font-size:clamp(24px,2.6vw,34px);font-weight:700;line-height:1;color:var(--fg);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
 .metric-definition{font-size:11px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.55;margin:0;max-width:760px}
 .metric-definition strong{color:var(--fg);font-weight:650}
 .metric-scale-wrap{display:grid;gap:3px;max-width:520px}
 .metric-scale{height:5px;border-radius:99px;background:var(--stroke);overflow:hidden}
 .metric-fill{display:block;height:100%;width:0%;border-radius:inherit;background:var(--accent);transition:width var(--motion-filter) var(--ease-editorial)}
 .metric-scale-ends{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;font-size:9.5px;color:var(--muted);font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}
 #rotation-note{font-size:11.5px;font-weight:500;line-height:1.55;margin:0}
 .matrices{border-top:1px solid var(--stroke);padding-top:9px;min-width:0}
 .matrices-head{display:flex;align-items:baseline;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:7px}
 .matrices-head h3{font-size:12px;margin:0}
 .matrices-head p{font-size:10px;color:var(--muted);margin:0}
 .matrix-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,minmax(0,1fr));gap:7px}
 .matrix-card{margin:0;border:1px solid var(--stroke);border-radius:9px;padding:6px 7px;background:var(--card);min-width:0}
 .matrix-card figcaption{font-size:9.5px;color:var(--muted);line-height:1.4;margin-bottom:3px;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis}
 .matrix-tag{font-weight:650;color:var(--fg)}
